OL,3,GNEWSAMarket town needs a banking hub,
OL,4,Acouncil argues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisation that assesses where
OL,7,Fbanking hubs should be built has been
OL,8,Furged to reconsider its decision not to
OL,9,Frecommend one for a market town.
OL,11,FHubs provide basic face-to-face
OL,12,Ffinancial services in areas lacking
OL,13,Fbank branches but LINK, which also runs
OL,14,Fthe UK's cash machine network, decided
OL,15,FFakenham did not need one.
OL,17,FNorth Norfolk District Council (NNDC)
OL,18,Fsaid it was "surprised" given the
OL,19,Ftown's size and "relative lack of
OL,20,Fpublic transport services", and has
OL,21,Fappealed against the decision.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
