OL,3,GNEWSAMarket town needs a banking hub,
OL,4,Acouncil argues
OL,5,
OL,6,FLINK said the community was "well
OL,7,Fserved by the local Post Office,
OL,8,FNationwide and free-to-use ATMs" but
OL,9,Fidentified the need for improved cash
OL,10,Fdeposit and withdrawal services.
